WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.770
Keep Chamber Empty
In the School Building

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.690
Funko-chan.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.820
I finally found them.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.620
Sixteen and Elle are here.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.080
Thanks, Sig-chan.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.370
So, what did you need?

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.700
I wanted Fujiko-sensei

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:24.580
from the high school section to help with the beach school leaflets.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.370
What?

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.580
You mean that really strict-looking teacher?

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:28.590
She's German, right?

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.170
She's so pretty.

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:33.720
It's true. Stopping power is attractive.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:37.550
English, Swiss, Belgian.

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:39.140
All you Europeans...

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.180
What's wrong, America?

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.560
Let's get going.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.820
Fujiko-sensei!

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:54.240
Fal's younger sister and her followers.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.280
<i>Followers?</i>

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.320
<i>We're not her followers.</i>

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.410
Yeah...

00:00:57.410 --> 00:00:59.490
What are you doing over here?

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:03.160
Well, I was asked to take care of the flower bed here,

00:01:03.160 --> 00:01:06.210
but I don't know which vegetable to plant during the summer.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.710
You're planting them in the flower bed?

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.040
That's correct.

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.840
It might be too late for summer vegetables,

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.170
but perhaps broccoli would work.

00:01:14.170 --> 00:01:17.130
<i>Broccoli...</i>

00:01:18.010 --> 00:01:20.390
Does broccoli have pretty flowers?

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.680
No clue.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.600
I couldn't care less about that.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.390
What's the fun of growing inedible flowers, anyway?

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:29.730
It's supposed to be a flower bed...

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:30.940
She's German, all right.

00:01:30.940 --> 00:01:32.270
Definitely.

00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.820
There are flowers that can be eaten, you know.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:35.990
Like edible chrysanthemums.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.410
I knew that. Those over there, right?

00:01:38.860 --> 00:01:40.660
They didn't really taste that, uh...

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.330
Those are dandelions.

00:01:42.330 --> 00:01:43.540
The Japanese variety are bitter, and—

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.200
What?! That's why they were so bitter!

00:01:46.370 --> 00:01:47.460
<i>She tasted some...</i>

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:48.710
<i>She ate them?</i>

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:51.880
Well, regardless...

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:53.800
There appears to have been some sort of error,

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.300
so your section is getting a new teacher soon.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:58.300
Oh? You mean the middle school?

00:01:58.630 --> 00:01:59.470
Correct.

00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:01.180
What do you mean by error?

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.300
No clue.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.390
But something seems to have gone awry.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.390
What the heck?

00:02:06.020 --> 00:02:07.600
I wonder what they'll be like.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:18.530
As we cast our eyes above to the boundless sky, we know

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:26.580
Whatever tomorrow brings, the sun will always shine

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:30.670
So won't you come with me?

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.720
It's almost time for the school bell to ring

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:49.940
And every moment by moment

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:52.350
I feel more and more like I could fly

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.820
This feeling fills my thoughts and sets my heart alight

00:02:55.980 --> 00:02:59.280
It's this moment I love most of all

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:03.950
In my bag I hold all the things I've overcome

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.700
And on their wings, I'll fly into the future

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:12.210
We can do anything, at any time and any place

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.710
And no one can stop us even if they try

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:20.340
From ING and that alone can we proceed

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:24.260
Carrying all our feelings as we go

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:28.270
Flying with our dreams for all to see

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:34.730
Let's close today's chapter, and start a new page!

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.820
Grip and hold!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:45.120
Grip and hold!
Grip and hold!

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:45.990
Grip and hold!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.460
Seishou Academy

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:53.000
This isn't good...
Seishou Academy

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.960
The shrine isn't on the map.
Seishou Academy

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:13.640
I did it! I got it!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:15.770
That was so cool, Onii-chan!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.060
That's too bad.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.980
You have to knock over the stand too.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:21.360
You never said that!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.940
I didn't tell you?

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:25.160
That isn't fair.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.030
If you want,

00:04:26.030 --> 00:04:27.320
you can give it another go.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.990
Let's just stop, Onii-chan.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:32.000
Come on...

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.920
Thanks.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.090
How about you let your big sister win it for you?

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:02.780
Wow!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.990
You're really good!

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.450
Not at all.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.240
Anyway, I got the stand too.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:09.870
Give the prize to these kids.

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:10.870
No way.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:13.620
What? I didn't cheat or anything!

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:15.000
That uniform...

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.410
You're from Seishou Academy, right?

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.420
You're a pro shot.

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:20.590
That didn't count.

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.460
That's terrible! You can't do that!

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.010
It's not happening.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.930
Then, may I give it a try?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:32.510
I'm just an amateur who happened to be passing by.

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:35.350
If you're an amateur, then I don't mind...

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.980
<i>Who is this guy?</i>

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.560
<i>His stance is ideal...</i>

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.530
<i>A secure grip, resting on the cheek,</i>

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.570
<i>while not pressuring the small stock.</i>

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:47.030
<i>He isn't holding on to the rifle.</i>

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.030
<i>It looks more like an extension of his body.</i>

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:51.410
<i>He's holding it that gently.</i>

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.660
<i>He slightly shifted his center of balance forward</i>

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:55.120
<i>to guard against recoil.</i>

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.120
<i>And he's in the forward leaning position.</i>

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:00.130
<i>His eye level's too high to aim a gun without a sight...</i>

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:06.720
<i>It's... It's almost like he's using a stance for firing an assault rifle.</i>

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:13.720
<i>I'm about to shoot...</i>

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:15.310
<i>My hammer's</i>

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:16.730
<i>going to fire...</i>

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:25.280
Ah! Hang on!

00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:26.650
Aim better!

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.860
Bye!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:30.610
Sorry.

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:34.120
<i>I'm really exhausted now...</i>

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.660
Hey, you. Hold up.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.290
So I ended up suddenly assigned to a new post.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:45.050
I had them send a map, but I still got lost.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:48.010
I heard a new teacher was coming,

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:50.380
but I never expected to run into you there.

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:54.470
So what's Seishou Academy like?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:58.520
You don't know anything about our school?

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.270
No.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:05.610
Well, I guess you could say it's an extremely specialized school.

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.570
Oh yeah...

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:10.950
That guy at the booth mentioned something about you being a pro shooter.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.070
Is there some kind of shooting club?

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:17.540
Actually, we're all guns.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:20.790
Huh?

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.290
My name is...

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:27.590
FNC.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.130
I was born in Belgium.

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:32.800
<i>A thong...</i>

00:07:33.260 --> 00:07:35.050
I'm an assault rifle.

00:07:35.470 --> 00:07:37.100
A Belgian...

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.390
assault...

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.560
thong...

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:48.530
Sorry to make you come all the way back to school.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:49.480
Thanks.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.360
No problem.

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:53.070
Well, see you at school on Monday.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.410
Yes, be careful on your way home.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:58.910
What's wrong?

00:07:58.910 --> 00:08:01.200
N-Nothing!

00:08:01.200 --> 00:08:02.000
See you!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:17.100
<i>I'd fire so fast...</i>

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.060
<i>with those big hands...</i>

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.100
<i>gripping me.</i>

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:29.980
I'll be starting here today. Thank you, Principal.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:31.570
No problem.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:35.910
Anyway, I'd like to show you our daily morning practice.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.620
Morning practice?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:50.550
"Keep your safety on at all times..."

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.970
Everyone's really going at it.

00:08:57.970 --> 00:08:59.640
They all have such good stances.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:02.520
Guns... You can't mean...

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.560
Oh, L85A1!

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:09.400
Hurry and get ready!

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.120
All right!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:27.420
I want you to hit the target within 7 centimeters at 100 meters with a cold shot.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.630
Remove the bullpup,

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:30.710
and use the iron sight. No other configurations allowed.

00:09:31.290 --> 00:09:35.260
Principal, those are real guns, aren't they?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:41.260
Well, yes, but the girls themselves are assault rifles too.

00:09:41.260 --> 00:09:43.810
It's their morning ritual.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:47.440
<i>What the hell?</i>

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:50.610
<i>They're guns? What's going on?</i>

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.940
<i>What kind of place is this?</i>

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.570
Good morning!

00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.450
You're late, FNC!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.610
Hurry up and get ready!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.530
Okay!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:01.450
Sensei!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:02.700
Hey.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:03.950
I met you the day before yesterday.

00:10:04.950 --> 00:10:06.960
<i>What was her name again?</i>

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.290
Oh, the girl with the thong.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.680
Idiot!

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.810
Stop firing!

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.990
Run away!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.450
Anyway, we're all guns.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:47.450
More specifically,

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.410
various guns from around the world

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.370
have gathered here at Seishou Academy.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:56.340
Assault rifle is a broad term for low-caliber guns, capable of fully-automatic fire,

00:10:56.340 --> 00:10:58.720
designed to neutralize specific targets.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:02.640
Every day, we follow our dreams to become great assault rifles,

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:04.890
and to study at this academy.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.810
It just so happens that

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.640
the person who will become your new homeroom teacher

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:11.940
is absent today.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.400
<i>It's not my fault!</i>

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.980
<i>It's the teacher's fault!</i>

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:17.820
<i>What did he mean that I'm the "girl with the thong"?</i>

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:21.990
I have skeleton stock, so I can't help it!

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.580
Good morning, Fal-san.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.210
'Sup?

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:34.630
Good morning, G3 and Fourteen.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.250
I heard about your sister.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:41.420
She put her homeroom teacher in the hospital on his first day.

00:11:41.420 --> 00:11:42.680
Good for her.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:45.510
I'm tired of hearing about that.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:50.270
I can't believe Funko would go and shoot someone up so thoughtlessly.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.940
I would've thought your sister

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.940
would be the one to do something like that.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:11:57.650
Sixteen, eh...

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.940
She's not stupid, but she sure acts that way sometimes.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.490
Hey, mind your own business!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.080
Eventually I'll have to punish Funko for her actions.

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.200
I'll help you with that!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.540
I'll be fine.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.000
Things would get all heated if you showed up.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:14.210
What does that mean?

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.750
Well, I guess if they managed to get Fourteen-san fired up,

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.590
that would be pretty impressive.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.220
What did I do to deserve this?

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.350
Hey, what are you thinking about?

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.020
Say...

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.350
Sixteen-chan...

00:12:37.440 --> 00:12:38.900
Sixteen-chan,

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:42.860
have you ever felt like your hammer was about to go off?

00:12:42.860 --> 00:12:44.860
<i>I can't ask her that...</i>

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:49.490
You're being weird.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:54.370
It's not really unusual to experience this at your age.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.250
Really?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.500
Yes. But,

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.550
that part of you is extremely precious,

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:03.090
so be sure to keep it clean and well-maintained.

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:04.510
Okay.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:09.470
Elle-chan.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.970
Your stomach hurts again?

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:13.140
Yeah.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.390
Lie down.

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.560
I'll take a look.

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:28.450
As I thought, your spring is weak.

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:30.620
So it's not recoiling properly.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:32.490
She jammed again?

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:44.300
Nope. I just don't get it...

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.840
<i>This is a good opportunity.</i>

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.970
<i>In case something happens to one of the students,</i>

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:51.050
<i>you should learn some first aid.</i>

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.720
<i>First aid?</i>

00:13:53.720 --> 00:13:55.730
<i>They're guns, you understand?</i>

00:13:56.600 --> 00:13:58.390
Yeah, but...

00:13:59.190 --> 00:14:01.560
I can't mess up and touch them somewhere wrong.

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:04.480
FNC...

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:05.990
That girl...

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:09.030
The hand-guard,

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:10.780
her chest...

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:13.240
If you accidentally touch it, you'll get burned, so be careful.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.910
<i>You can't, Sensei!</i>

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:18.460
<i>I'm so hot right here...</i>

00:14:19.790 --> 00:14:21.420
FNC, what's wrong?

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.250
Nothing...

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:28.010
The gun's stock is kind of like her butt...

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.640
The FNC has a skeleton stock.

00:14:31.140 --> 00:14:33.300
So that's why she wears a thong.

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:35.720
I see...

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.440
Wait, what?

00:14:45.150 --> 00:14:46.980
What's wrong, FNC?

00:14:46.980 --> 00:14:49.860
No! It's nothing...

00:14:50.660 --> 00:14:52.700
I'm not like that.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.280
You're going to visit him? Our teacher?

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:56.040
That's right.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.540
Make sure you lock up,

00:14:57.540 --> 00:14:58.580
Elle!

00:14:59.830 --> 00:15:02.420
It's been a week since he was admitted to the hospital.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:05.460
He hasn't spent any time actually being a homeroom teacher.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:08.630
Sure, he might have said something bad,

00:15:08.630 --> 00:15:11.880
but Funko-chan is still the reason why was he was hospitalized in the first place.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.890
There's nothing to worry about.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.720
You're concerned about him, right, Funko?

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:19.270
Why would I...

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.690
Weren't you close enough that he saw your panties?

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:23.310
Hey, hey!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:25.020
See? You're all red.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:26.360
I am not!

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:29.280
I don't want to visit him!

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:30.990
Oh yeah?

00:15:31.650 --> 00:15:33.660
Ah, Elle. Thanks.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:34.070
Sure.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:35.990
Strike!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:42.920
Why would a human teacher come here?

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:45.960
But a human teacher...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.630
Safe!

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.930
...might shoot us off, you know?

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.810
You're adorable,

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:04.100
FNC.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.400
You're dirty, Sixteen-chan.

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:08.150
Huh? How?

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:09.780
You're a perv...

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:11.490
